# TaskMate — AI Task Assistant 🤖

TaskMate is a simple AI agent built with **@mastra/core** and **Gemini** that helps users manage tasks on **Telex.im**.

### 🚀 Features
- Add tasks with or without deadlines
- List all tasks
- Conversational Telex integration

### 🧠 Stack
- Node.js
- @mastra/core
- Gemini API (via Google AI)
- Telex.im (A2A protocol)

### 🏃 How to Run
```bash
npm install
node index.js
